PART 36. GEMINI API ERROR HANDLING
==================================================

Implement robust AI error handling.

Handle:
- 503 UNAVAILABLE.
- 429 RESOURCE EXHAUSTED.
- 500 INTERNAL.
- 502 BAD GATEWAY.
- Network errors.
- Authentication errors.

